  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_8466.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Las fiestas del Barri de Sant Pere, en Onda, han continuado este martes con las vaquillas y toros de la ganader&iacute;a de Armando Beltr&aacute;n Colom, dos de ellos embolados por la noche, todo bajo el patrocinio de &#39;Manolo el &nbsp;Chato&#39; (a la izquierda de la foto, con camiseta roja).</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8465.jpg\" alt=\"img_8465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8466.jpg\" alt=\"img_8466\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8468.jpg\" alt=\"img_8468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8469.jpg\" alt=\"img_8469\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8472.jpg\" alt=\"img_8472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8473.jpg\" alt=\"img_8473\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8474.jpg\" alt=\"img_8474\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestesbarrisantpere14/img_8475.jpg\" alt=\"img_8475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd